# Go tests

Before creating, modifying, reviewing, or reasoning about tests, read and follow @.agents/TESTING_GO.md.

`.agents/TESTING_GO.md` is the only source of testing conventions for this repo.

Do not duplicate those conventions in this rule. Do not invent a different test style.
